        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Mohrg Spawn"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(occult, necromancy)\n\nA living creature slain by a mohrg that had a lower level than the mohrg rises as a mohrg spawn (Pathfinder Bestiary 2 172) after 1d4 rounds, on its turn. This mohrg spawn is under the command of the mohrg that created it. If the creator of the mohrg spawn is destroyed, the mohrg spawn is destroyed as well, immediately collapsing into a pile of decayed flesh and bones."
            },
            "id": "60aa0a69-f2a5-452e-9865-7e35f1e45fcf",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:59:14.471514"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Cruel Reactions"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "Taon gains an extra reaction each round that can be used only to make an Attack of Opportunity."
            },
            "id": "78de28c9-31d4-403f-ba4d-ebc9f66bd0b1",
            "updated_at": {
